 from `src/index.ts`.
 
 Run its tests with `npm test`.
+
+Every task has an `id`, a string unique within its list. It is set when the task is added and does not change
+when the task is renamed, so the app can keep referring to a task by its id. The methods that take a task's
+title also accept its id; the id is looked up first, so a title that happens to equal another task's id
+refers to that task.
